      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "my thoughts go back to the moon dust demo game. You didnt have to squeeze to pick up items just had to close your hand. How it currently works with sqeezing to pick up is nice so you dont accidently pickup items when you close your hand. But for dark worlds where you have to constantly hold on to a flashlight. Peoples hands will gradually loosen over time and will accidently drop the item. So you could have squeezing to pickup but not dropping until you do open hand.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
