      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree with this, but I also think you should not have to grip the controllers at all in order to grab items. From people who've played games like Boneworks or Moondust with the Index controllers, they say it is a lot more immersive to grab using the mechanic of closing their hands around the controllers instead of gripping, as the rest position of your hand on the controllers are supposed to be open hand anyway.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
