      "statusChangeID": "5cf805044292c519144581f9",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "I'm marking this as complete due to the fact that in 2019.2.3's latest build, you now have the choice (via SteamVR's Controller Bindings) to handle object grabbing via \"Grip Release\" or \"Open Hand Release\", which behaves a bit like you've described. Try both!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
